      "locked": false,
      "text": "A15 无前置：正常结束、异常、取消、通信结束均安全收尾。",
      "originalText": "A15 无前置：正常结束、异常、取消、通信结束均安全收尾。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "analysis-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 635,
      "height": 88,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "未选静磁场曲线：自动执行 B01–B04，待选择标定曲线。\n来源切换仅使 B05、B06 失效；本轮原始数据与谱分离结果保留。",
      "originalText": "未选静磁场曲线：自动执行 B01–B04，待选择标定曲线。\n来源切换仅使 B05、B06 失效；本轮原始数据与谱分离结果保留。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "calibration-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 630,
      "height": 110,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "标定来源：静磁场原始格式 3 直流逐点色散（参数 schema 3/4 历史或显式 raw3）。\n检测增益 = |dY/dV| / 本轮 K_Z；真值 = 波形 PSD × K_Z²。\n来源只读；有限采样、完整曲线、拟合门槛和 SHA-256 不放宽。",
      "originalText": "标定来源：静磁场原始格式 3 直流逐点色散（参数 schema 3/4 历史或显式 raw3）。\n检测增益 = |dY/dV| / 本轮 K_Z；真值 = 波形 PSD × K_Z²。\n来源只读；有限采样、完整曲线、拟合门槛和 SHA-256 不放宽。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
